@HostAddress = {{HostAddress}}

### Liveness probe -- always 200, runs no checks (see HealthChecks/README.md)
GET {{HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness probe -- runs `ready`-tagged checks, cached 15s
GET {{HostAddress}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document -- Production-gated (see OpenApi/OpenApiExtensions.cs), 404s there
GET {{HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Mint a development JWT -- Development environment only (see DevTokenEndpoint.cs);
### the "token" name below lets the forecast request reuse its response without copy-pasting.
# @name token
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "me"
}

### Weather forecast, authenticated with the token minted above
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/weather/forecast?latitude=52.52&longitude=13.40&days=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Weather forecast without a token -- expect 401 ProblemDetails
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/weather/forecast?latitude=52.52&longitude=13.40&days=3

### Weather forecast with an invalid query param -- expect 400 ProblemDetails (FluentValidation)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/weather/forecast?latitude=999&longitude=13.40&days=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.$.accessToken}}
